From 8dac0c18fab53e89df01e4aed2719af121a640ed Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <claude@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 23 Aug 2026 07:28:53 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Digitika: student Q&A/forum, admin classroom
 (announcements + grading, no instructor role), low-bandwidth video mode

- Schema: Lesson.videoUrlSd, CourseAnnouncement, CourseThread, CourseReply
- New 'classroom' admin permission module (digitika.classroom.view/manage) -
  lives in the existing admin dashboard, not a separate instructor portal
- Student: per-course discussion threads/replies, announcements feed,
  data-saver video toggle (click-to-load + optional low-bitrate source)
- Admin: /admin/classroom page - post/delete announcements, moderate and
  reply to student questions (pin/unpin), per-course grade roster
  (progress pct + quiz scores) with a manual lesson-completion override API

Note: course content delivery, per-student progress tracking, and the
referral programme were already implemented on this branch (29a9ea0,
b784f07) - not touched here.

Not run in this environment: prisma generate / pnpm build (no network
access to binaries.prisma.sh from the sandbox this was written in).
Please run typecheck + build before merging.
