From: Claude <claude@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 23 Aug 2026 13:55:30 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Compress and cap source images at 1600px width (~11MB ->
 ~4.9MB)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Re-encoded all JPEGs (mozjpeg q78) and PNGs (palette, q80), and downscaled
anything wider than 1600px since nothing on the site renders larger than
that. Paths/extensions unchanged, so no code references needed updating.

Skipped public/images/MUSICA HACKATHON/SPK_6502.jpg — it's a pre-existing
corrupted/truncated JPEG already in the repo (unrelated to this change);
flagging separately, it should be re-uploaded from source.

sitemap.xml, robots.txt, and JSON-LD structured data were already fully
implemented on this branch (src/app/sitemap.ts, src/app/robots.ts,
src/lib/json-ld.tsx wired into layout/course/blog pages) - not touched.
